Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.87,0:12:06.96,Staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}校对：阿托　时轴：4323　后期：白斩鸡白斩鸡
Dialogue: 6,0:00:13.34,0:00:14.54,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミ
Dialogue: 7,0:00:13.34,0:00:14.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美
Dialogue: 6,0:00:14.54,0:00:16.41,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナ
Dialogue: 7,0:00:14.54,0:00:16.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,席娜
Dialogue: 6,0:00:16.41,0:00:18.84,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,今日は風が気持ちいいね
Dialogue: 7,0:00:16.41,0:00:18.84,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,今天的风吹着很舒服呢
Dialogue: 6,0:00:22.70,0:00:25.88,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ね　お昼休みまだ時間あるよね
Dialogue: 7,0:00:22.70,0:00:25.88,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,话说  午休还剩点时间
Dialogue: 6,0:00:26.35,0:00:28.63,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,裏庭でクッキー食べよう
Dialogue: 7,0:00:26.35,0:00:28.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我们去后院吃点饼干吧
Dialogue: 6,0:00:33.75,0:00:34.88,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,美味しい
Dialogue: 7,0:00:33.75,0:00:34.88,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好好吃
Dialogue: 6,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.64,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,何読んでるの
Dialogue: 7,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.64,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你在看什么呢
Dialogue: 6,0:00:38.64,0:00:41.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,実践魔法の本だよ
Dialogue: 7,0:00:38.64,0:00:41.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,在看实用魔法的书
Dialogue: 6,0:00:41.00,0:00:42.83,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,先週借りたんだけど
Dialogue: 7,0:00:41.00,0:00:42.83,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,上周借来的
Dialogue: 6,0:00:42.83,0:00:45.10,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,返却期限今日なんだよね
Dialogue: 7,0:00:42.83,0:00:45.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不过今天就要还了
Dialogue: 6,0:00:45.10,0:00:48.75,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ええ　シーナまた勉強してるの
Dialogue: 7,0:00:45.10,0:00:48.75,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,什么  席娜你怎么又在学习啊
Dialogue: 6,0:00:48.75,0:00:51.57,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,まだまだ知らないこといっぱいあるから
Dialogue: 7,0:00:48.75,0:00:51.57,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,因为我还有很多不知道的知识嘛
Dialogue: 6,0:00:53.56,0:00:55.29,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,別にいいじゃん
Dialogue: 7,0:00:53.56,0:00:55.29,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不知道也没关系的啦
Dialogue: 6,0:00:56.84,0:00:57.91,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,最近ね
Dialogue: 7,0:00:56.84,0:00:57.91,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,最近啊
Dialogue: 6,0:00:58.56,0:01:01.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,自分の魔法について調べてるんだ
Dialogue: 7,0:00:58.56,0:01:01.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我在调查自己的魔法
Dialogue: 6,0:01:01.13,0:01:03.02,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナの魔法？
Dialogue: 7,0:01:01.13,0:01:03.02,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,席娜的魔法？
Dialogue: 6,0:01:03.49,0:01:04.38,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 7,0:01:03.49,0:01:04.38,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 6,0:01:04.96,0:01:06.01,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,前は
Dialogue: 7,0:01:04.96,0:01:06.01,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,以前我总在想
Dialogue: 6,0:01:06.01,0:01:08.73,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みんなと違ってうまくできないな
Dialogue: 7,0:01:06.01,0:01:08.73,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我不像大家那样  什么都做不好
Dialogue: 6,0:01:08.73,0:01:10.20,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,嫌だなって
Dialogue: 7,0:01:08.73,0:01:10.20,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,很讨厌这样的自己
Dialogue: 6,0:01:10.62,0:01:12.97,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,そればかり考えてたけど
Dialogue: 7,0:01:10.62,0:01:12.97,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我满脑子想的都是这些
Dialogue: 6,0:01:16.68,0:01:18.90,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,まるで平和な青空に
Dialogue: 7,0:01:16.68,0:01:18.90,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,在这风轻云净的青空下
Dialogue: 6,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.35,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いつもと同じ時間が過ぎていく
Dialogue: 7,0:01:19.56,0:01:22.35,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,时间一如往常地流逝着
Dialogue: 6,0:01:23.84,0:01:26.32,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あの子の足りない教室で
Dialogue: 7,0:01:23.84,0:01:26.32,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,在失去了她的教室里
Dialogue: 6,0:01:26.32,0:01:30.65,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,私たちはまた　日常に馴染んでいく
Dialogue: 7,0:01:26.32,0:01:30.65,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我们的生活也渐渐回归了日常
Dialogue: 6,0:01:32.43,0:01:36.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,じゃあ　ミミはシーナを応援する係しよう
Dialogue: 7,0:01:32.43,0:01:36.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那美美就来负责给你加油吧
Dialogue: 6,0:01:36.08,0:01:37.20,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,係？
Dialogue: 7,0:01:36.08,0:01:37.20,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,负责？
Dialogue: 6,0:03:09.33,0:03:12.09,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,この魔法の分解式を書いていくと
Dialogue: 7,0:03:09.33,0:03:12.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,把这个魔法的分解式写出来
Dialogue: 6,0:03:12.09,0:03:13.42,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,こうなります
Dialogue: 7,0:03:12.09,0:03:13.42,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,就像这个样子
Dialogue: 6,0:03:17.38,0:03:20.35,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,攻撃魔法のように魔力を打つんじゃなく
Dialogue: 7,0:03:17.38,0:03:20.35,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不是像攻击魔法那样将魔力打出去
Dialogue: 6,0:03:21.05,0:03:22.52,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,流し込む
Dialogue: 7,0:03:21.05,0:03:22.52,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,而是注入进去
Dialogue: 6,0:03:23.97,0:03:28.72,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,どんな生き物でも自分の内側に異物が入るのは拒否する
Dialogue: 7,0:03:23.97,0:03:28.72,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,任何生物都会排斥进入自己体内的异物
Dialogue: 6,0:03:29.42,0:03:32.30,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,拒絶反応って聞いたことあるでしょ
Dialogue: 7,0:03:29.42,0:03:32.30,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你应该听说过排异反应吧
Dialogue: 6,0:03:32.30,0:03:33.32,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 7,0:03:32.30,0:03:33.32,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,听过
Dialogue: 6,0:03:33.32,0:03:36.72,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,魔力だって異物の一種には違いない
Dialogue: 7,0:03:33.32,0:03:36.72,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,魔力说到底也是一种异物
Dialogue: 6,0:03:37.12,0:03:39.91,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だから「異物じゃないですよ」
Dialogue: 7,0:03:37.12,0:03:39.91,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,所以要告诉对方「这不是异物哦」
Dialogue: 6,0:03:39.91,0:03:43.20,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,「あなたの味方ですよ」「平気ですよ」って
Dialogue: 7,0:03:39.91,0:03:43.20,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,「是你的伙伴哦」「没事的哦」这样
Dialogue: 6,0:03:43.56,0:03:45.65,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,優しくそっと流し込んでいくの
Dialogue: 7,0:03:43.56,0:03:45.65,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,温柔地  轻轻地将魔力注入进去
Dialogue: 6,0:03:50.73,0:03:53.52,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,まだまだ　うまくできないけど
Dialogue: 7,0:03:50.73,0:03:53.52,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,虽然我现在做得还不够好
Dialogue: 6,0:03:54.34,0:03:57.15,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,攻撃魔法なんかよりも感覚はわかる
Dialogue: 7,0:03:54.34,0:03:57.15,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但感觉比攻击魔法更容易理解
Dialogue: 6,0:03:57.93,0:04:01.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もしうまくできるようになったら
Dialogue: 7,0:03:57.93,0:04:01.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,如果我能熟练掌握这个魔法
Dialogue: 6,0:04:03.35,0:04:05.50,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,傷ついた人を癒すことも
Dialogue: 7,0:04:03.35,0:04:05.50,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,就能治疗伤员了
Dialogue: 6,0:04:06.98,0:04:09.36,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,この式を書いておくように
Dialogue: 7,0:04:06.98,0:04:09.36,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家先把这个式子抄下来
Dialogue: 6,0:04:09.36,0:04:12.18,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,次回はこの解析から始めます
Dialogue: 7,0:04:09.36,0:04:12.18,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,下节课我们再解析这个式子
Dialogue: 6,0:04:12.18,0:04:12.86,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,やば
Dialogue: 7,0:04:12.18,0:04:12.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 6,0:04:12.86,0:04:14.02,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,終わった？
Dialogue: 7,0:04:12.86,0:04:14.02,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,下课了？
Dialogue: 6,0:04:14.02,0:04:16.40,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミも早くあの式写して
Dialogue: 7,0:04:14.02,0:04:16.40,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美快把那个式子抄下来
Dialogue: 6,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.27,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,オミ先生に怒られるよ
Dialogue: 7,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.27,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不然会被欧咪老师骂的
Dialogue: 6,0:04:20.34,0:04:23.57,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,でもノート… 書くとこない
Dialogue: 7,0:04:20.34,0:04:23.57,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,可是我的笔记本… 已经没地方写了
Dialogue: 6,0:04:25.35,0:04:26.24,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あのね
Dialogue: 7,0:04:25.35,0:04:26.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我说你啊
Dialogue: 6,0:04:26.90,0:04:29.17,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,お腹すいたー
Dialogue: 7,0:04:26.90,0:04:29.17,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,肚子好饿啊
Dialogue: 6,0:04:29.17,0:04:30.43,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,おやつ食べに行こう
Dialogue: 7,0:04:29.17,0:04:30.43,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我们去吃点心吧
Dialogue: 6,0:04:30.43,0:04:32.02,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,え？ああ…
Dialogue: 7,0:04:30.43,0:04:32.02,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,诶？这个…
Dialogue: 6,0:04:32.02,0:04:33.11,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ごめん
Dialogue: 7,0:04:32.02,0:04:33.11,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 6,0:04:33.11,0:04:35.16,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,この後用事があるから
Dialogue: 7,0:04:33.11,0:04:35.16,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我待会还有些事情要做
Dialogue: 6,0:04:35.16,0:04:37.84,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ええ　また保健医のとこ？
Dialogue: 7,0:04:35.16,0:04:37.84,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,啊  你又要去校医那里吗？
Dialogue: 6,0:04:41.85,0:04:42.72,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 7,0:04:41.85,0:04:42.72,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 6,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.68,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ええー
Dialogue: 7,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.68,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 6,0:04:44.68,0:04:46.84,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,夕方には戻るから
Dialogue: 7,0:04:44.68,0:04:46.84,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,等到傍晚我就回来了
Dialogue: 6,0:04:46.84,0:04:48.60,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,晩ご飯は一緒に食べよう
Dialogue: 7,0:04:46.84,0:04:48.60,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,然后我们一起去吃个晚饭吧
Dialogue: 6,0:04:51.94,0:04:53.48,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミも行く
Dialogue: 7,0:04:51.94,0:04:53.48,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美也要去
Dialogue: 6,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.90,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,一緒に行く
Dialogue: 7,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.90,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美也要跟你一起去
Dialogue: 6,0:05:03.14,0:05:04.58,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,仕方ないな
Dialogue: 7,0:05:03.14,0:05:04.58,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真拿你没办法
Dialogue: 6,0:05:08.90,0:05:10.07,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,失礼しまーす
Dialogue: 7,0:05:08.90,0:05:10.07,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 6,0:05:16.52,0:05:18.77,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,保健医！
Dialogue: 7,0:05:16.52,0:05:18.77,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,校医！
Dialogue: 6,0:05:18.77,0:05:20.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シー
Dialogue: 7,0:05:18.77,0:05:20.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 6,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.07,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,保健室だから
Dialogue: 7,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.07,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,医务室里小声一点
Dialogue: 6,0:05:26.22,0:05:28.18,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,「再生よろしく」
Dialogue: 7,0:05:26.22,0:05:28.18,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,「麻烦你再生一下这些植物咯」
Dialogue: 6,0:05:30.35,0:05:34.54,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,「ついでに瓶詰めして　ラベルもよろしく」
Dialogue: 7,0:05:30.35,0:05:34.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,「顺便帮我用瓶子装一下  再贴个标签」
Dialogue: 6,0:05:36.82,0:05:37.98,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,えっと
Dialogue: 7,0:05:36.82,0:05:37.98,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 6,0:05:38.53,0:05:40.20,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,この植物って…
Dialogue: 7,0:05:38.53,0:05:40.20,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这个植物是…
Dialogue: 6,0:05:40.79,0:05:41.49,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ねえ
Dialogue: 7,0:05:40.79,0:05:41.49,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我说
Dialogue: 6,0:05:41.49,0:05:42.78,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,すぐ終わる？
Dialogue: 7,0:05:41.49,0:05:42.78,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,这个要花很久吗？
Dialogue: 6,0:05:43.28,0:05:46.50,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うーん… すぐは無理かな
Dialogue: 7,0:05:43.28,0:05:46.50,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯… 估计挺久的吧
Dialogue: 6,0:05:48.54,0:05:49.87,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,えっと…
Dialogue: 7,0:05:48.54,0:05:49.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 6,0:05:54.86,0:05:55.86,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,これ…
Dialogue: 7,0:05:54.86,0:05:55.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 6,0:05:57.54,0:06:01.28,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,「花を摘んでいつもの手順でよろしく」
Dialogue: 7,0:05:57.54,0:06:01.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,「按平时的步骤  帮我把花摘下来」
Dialogue: 6,0:06:05.78,0:06:07.43,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,この花摘むの
Dialogue: 7,0:06:05.78,0:06:07.43,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,要把这些花摘下来吗
Dialogue: 6,0:06:07.43,0:06:08.06,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,え？
Dialogue: 7,0:06:07.43,0:06:08.06,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 6,0:06:08.06,0:06:09.85,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミが摘んでおいてあげる
Dialogue: 7,0:06:08.06,0:06:09.85,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美马上就帮你摘好
Dialogue: 6,0:06:09.85,0:06:11.39,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ああ　ダメダメ
Dialogue: 7,0:06:09.85,0:06:11.39,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哎呀  不行不行
Dialogue: 6,0:06:12.08,0:06:14.50,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,その花は決まった摘み方しないと
Dialogue: 7,0:06:12.08,0:06:14.50,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那种花如果不按固定步骤摘的话
Dialogue: 6,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.54,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,次の花が咲いてくれないの
Dialogue: 7,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,就再也不会开花了
Dialogue: 6,0:06:16.54,0:06:17.59,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ええ？
Dialogue: 7,0:06:16.54,0:06:17.59,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 6,0:06:17.59,0:06:19.03,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,どうやるの？
Dialogue: 7,0:06:17.59,0:06:19.03,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,那要怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 6,0:06:20.18,0:06:23.11,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,時間をかけて一つ一つ
Dialogue: 7,0:06:20.18,0:06:23.11,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,花时间一朵一朵地摘
Dialogue: 6,0:06:23.48,0:06:24.79,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ん？
Dialogue: 7,0:06:23.48,0:06:24.79,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 6,0:06:24.79,0:06:25.84,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ううん
Dialogue: 7,0:06:24.79,0:06:25.84,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 6,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,私がやるからそこに置いといて
Dialogue: 7,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你放在那里让我来摘吧
Dialogue: 6,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.44,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あそこの花は？
Dialogue: 7,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.44,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,那边的花呢？
Dialogue: 6,0:06:32.44,0:06:33.54,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ああ　ダメ
Dialogue: 7,0:06:32.44,0:06:33.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊  不行
Dialogue: 6,0:06:33.91,0:06:36.67,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,それも丁寧に扱わないと
Dialogue: 7,0:06:33.91,0:06:36.67,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那些花也要小心对待
Dialogue: 6,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.81,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,じゃあどうすればいいの
Dialogue: 7,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.81,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那到底要怎么做嘛
Dialogue: 6,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.02,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うーん
Dialogue: 7,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.02,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 6,0:06:46.07,0:06:48.10,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,終わったらすぐ戻るから
Dialogue: 7,0:06:46.07,0:06:48.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我做完马上就回来
Dialogue: 6,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.20,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,追い出しちゃった
Dialogue: 7,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.20,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,把她赶出去了
Dialogue: 6,0:06:55.02,0:06:57.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,でも分かって
Dialogue: 7,0:06:55.02,0:06:57.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但是希望你能理解我
Dialogue: 6,0:06:58.11,0:07:00.53,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,私もミミやみんなのように
Dialogue: 7,0:06:58.11,0:07:00.53,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我也想和美美还有大家一样
Dialogue: 6,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.40,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,誰かの役に立ちたい
Dialogue: 7,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.40,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,能为别人尽一份力
Dialogue: 6,0:07:02.98,0:07:06.55,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,自分の力が誰かの助けになれるように
Dialogue: 7,0:07:02.98,0:07:06.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,为了让自己的力量能帮到别人
Dialogue: 6,0:07:15.39,0:07:17.96,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,退屈
Dialogue: 7,0:07:15.39,0:07:17.96,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好无聊啊
Dialogue: 6,0:07:18.33,0:07:21.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,退屈退屈退屈…
Dialogue: 7,0:07:18.33,0:07:21.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好无聊好无聊真的好无聊嘛…
Dialogue: 6,0:07:31.51,0:07:32.81,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,え？
Dialogue: 7,0:07:31.51,0:07:32.81,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 6,0:07:33.49,0:07:34.81,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ハルだ
Dialogue: 7,0:07:33.49,0:07:34.81,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是哈鲁诶
Dialogue: 6,0:07:36.77,0:07:38.89,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,同じクラスのミミだよ
Dialogue: 7,0:07:36.77,0:07:38.89,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我是和你同班的美美哦
Dialogue: 6,0:07:39.64,0:07:40.86,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,知ってるよ
Dialogue: 7,0:07:39.64,0:07:40.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我认识你
Dialogue: 6,0:07:41.40,0:07:44.60,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,返礼の日に隣の本棚掃除してた
Dialogue: 7,0:07:41.40,0:07:44.60,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,回礼日那天我还打扫了你旁边的那个书架呢
Dialogue: 6,0:07:44.60,0:07:46.51,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だから知ってるってば
Dialogue: 7,0:07:44.60,0:07:46.51,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,都说了我认识你
Dialogue: 6,0:07:46.51,0:07:47.74,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ほんと？
Dialogue: 7,0:07:46.51,0:07:47.74,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 6,0:07:47.74,0:07:50.23,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ハルあんまり教室にいないから
Dialogue: 7,0:07:47.74,0:07:50.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我看你都不怎么去教室呢
Dialogue: 6,0:07:51.47,0:07:53.58,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いつもここにいるからね
Dialogue: 7,0:07:51.47,0:07:53.58,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,因为我经常待在这里啊
Dialogue: 6,0:07:54.00,0:07:55.21,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,そっかー
Dialogue: 7,0:07:54.00,0:07:55.21,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 6,0:07:58.81,0:08:00.04,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,何してんの
Dialogue: 7,0:07:58.81,0:08:00.04,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你在干什么呢
Dialogue: 6,0:08:00.48,0:08:02.83,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あんまりバフってしない
Dialogue: 7,0:08:00.48,0:08:02.83,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这床一点也不蓬松
Dialogue: 6,0:08:02.83,0:08:03.63,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,バフ？
Dialogue: 7,0:08:02.83,0:08:03.63,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,蓬松？
Dialogue: 6,0:08:03.63,0:08:07.22,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,晴れた日にマットを干してシーツ洗うと
Dialogue: 7,0:08:03.63,0:08:07.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,如果晴天把床垫拿出去晒  再洗一洗床单的话
Dialogue: 6,0:08:07.65,0:08:09.22,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,バフってするんだよ
Dialogue: 7,0:08:07.65,0:08:09.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,床就会变得很蓬松哦
Dialogue: 6,0:08:10.10,0:08:12.58,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナよくやってくれるんだ
Dialogue: 7,0:08:10.10,0:08:12.58,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,席娜她经常这么做
Dialogue: 6,0:08:14.98,0:08:18.24,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,空いてるベッドなら他にいくらでもあるけど
Dialogue: 7,0:08:14.98,0:08:18.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这里不是还有很多空床位吗
Dialogue: 6,0:08:18.64,0:08:19.40,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ん？
Dialogue: 7,0:08:18.64,0:08:19.40,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 6,0:08:20.74,0:08:22.40,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ここにいたら邪魔
Dialogue: 7,0:08:20.74,0:08:22.40,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我在这会打扰到你吗
Dialogue: 6,0:08:24.21,0:08:25.28,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,まあね
Dialogue: 7,0:08:24.21,0:08:25.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 6,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.11,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,今日はせっかく宿題ないのに
Dialogue: 7,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.11,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好不容易今天不用写作业
Dialogue: 6,0:08:28.11,0:08:30.23,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みんな勉強好きだな
Dialogue: 7,0:08:28.11,0:08:30.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家还真是喜欢学习呢
Dialogue: 6,0:08:30.23,0:08:33.01,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,別に　好きでやってないよ
Dialogue: 7,0:08:30.23,0:08:33.01,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我也不是因为喜欢才学的
Dialogue: 6,0:08:33.01,0:08:36.02,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,授業休んだ分　自習してるだけだから
Dialogue: 7,0:08:33.01,0:08:36.02,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,只是我请假缺席的课程需要我自学去补上罢了
Dialogue: 6,0:08:36.02,0:08:40.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ええ　ミミは宿題以外やんないもん
Dialogue: 7,0:08:36.02,0:08:40.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是吗  美美都做完作业就了事的
Dialogue: 6,0:08:40.00,0:08:41.25,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,すごいね
Dialogue: 7,0:08:40.00,0:08:41.25,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你真厉害呢
Dialogue: 6,0:08:42.32,0:08:45.96,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,何も… 何もすごくなんか…
Dialogue: 7,0:08:42.32,0:08:45.96,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我… 一点也不厉害…
Dialogue: 6,0:08:47.46,0:08:48.68,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫
Dialogue: 7,0:08:47.46,0:08:48.68,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 6,0:08:53.65,0:08:55.32,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,風邪ひどいの
Dialogue: 7,0:08:53.65,0:08:55.32,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,感冒很严重吗
Dialogue: 6,0:08:56.64,0:08:57.71,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,風邪じゃない
Dialogue: 7,0:08:56.64,0:08:57.71,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不是感冒
Dialogue: 6,0:08:58.27,0:09:00.12,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いつもこんなだよ
Dialogue: 7,0:08:58.27,0:09:00.12,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我一直都这样
Dialogue: 6,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.53,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,咳が止まらなかったり
Dialogue: 7,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.53,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,有时会突然开始咳个不停
Dialogue: 6,0:09:02.53,0:09:05.19,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,日に当たるとすぐ熱が出たり
Dialogue: 7,0:09:02.53,0:09:05.19,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,经常一晒到太阳就会马上发烧
Dialogue: 6,0:09:05.58,0:09:09.30,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だから実習で　みんなと同じことができない分
Dialogue: 7,0:09:05.58,0:09:09.30,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,虽然我在实训课上没法做到和大家一样的事
Dialogue: 6,0:09:09.30,0:09:12.56,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,せめて勉強くらいは負けたくないんだ
Dialogue: 7,0:09:09.30,0:09:12.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但至少我不想在学习上也输掉
Dialogue: 6,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.41,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,それ　こないだのテスト
Dialogue: 7,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这是前段时间的考试吗
Dialogue: 6,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.63,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,すごい
Dialogue: 7,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 6,0:09:16.63,0:09:17.61,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,嫌味？
Dialogue: 7,0:09:16.63,0:09:17.61,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,这是在嘲讽我吗？
Dialogue: 6,0:09:18.11,0:09:20.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,赤点ギリギリなんだけど
Dialogue: 7,0:09:18.11,0:09:20.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我可是差点就不及格了啊
Dialogue: 6,0:09:20.68,0:09:21.83,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,負けた
Dialogue: 7,0:09:20.68,0:09:21.83,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我输了
Dialogue: 6,0:09:21.83,0:09:23.87,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,何　この汚いの
Dialogue: 7,0:09:21.83,0:09:23.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这些乱七八糟的是什么东西
Dialogue: 6,0:09:24.20,0:09:26.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,上手に描けてるでしょ
Dialogue: 7,0:09:24.20,0:09:26.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,画得不错吧
Dialogue: 6,0:09:27.60,0:09:30.50,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,君に勝っても全然嬉しくないよ
Dialogue: 7,0:09:27.60,0:09:30.50,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,就算赢了你  我也完全开心不起来
Dialogue: 6,0:09:30.50,0:09:31.55,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,どうして
Dialogue: 7,0:09:30.50,0:09:31.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 6,0:09:32.59,0:09:34.81,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミより良い点数なのに
Dialogue: 7,0:09:32.59,0:09:34.81,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,明明分数比美美要高
Dialogue: 6,0:09:34.81,0:09:36.53,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,どうして嬉しくないの
Dialogue: 7,0:09:34.81,0:09:36.53,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,为什么开心不起来呢
Dialogue: 6,0:09:36.94,0:09:38.39,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,そりゃそうでしょ
Dialogue: 7,0:09:36.94,0:09:38.39,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这不是理所当然的嘛
Dialogue: 6,0:09:39.74,0:09:42.60,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナも嬉しそうじゃないんだ
Dialogue: 7,0:09:39.74,0:09:42.60,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,席娜看起来也不开心
Dialogue: 6,0:09:43.27,0:09:45.24,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いつも良い点なのに
Dialogue: 7,0:09:43.27,0:09:45.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,明明成绩一直都很好
Dialogue: 6,0:09:45.73,0:09:47.36,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,こんなんじゃダメだって
Dialogue: 7,0:09:45.73,0:09:47.36,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,却还是说这样还不够
Dialogue: 6,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.53,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミには分からないよって
Dialogue: 7,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.53,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,还说美美是不会理解的
Dialogue: 6,0:09:55.00,0:09:58.26,Text - JP,,0,900,0,,シーナダメじゃないのに
Dialogue: 7,0:09:55.00,0:09:58.26,Text - CN,,0,900,0,,明明席娜已经足够优秀了
Dialogue: 6,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.23,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,君は…
Dialogue: 7,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你啊…
Dialogue: 6,0:10:02.47,0:10:04.54,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ここの役に立っているだろう
Dialogue: 7,0:10:02.47,0:10:04.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,已经做好了你在这里的职责了吧
Dialogue: 6,0:10:04.87,0:10:05.67,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ん？
Dialogue: 7,0:10:04.87,0:10:05.67,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 6,0:10:06.28,0:10:08.20,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,この学校の…
Dialogue: 7,0:10:06.28,0:10:08.20,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,为这个学校…
Dialogue: 6,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.44,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みんなの役に立っている
Dialogue: 7,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.44,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,为大家做出了很多贡献
Dialogue: 6,0:10:11.18,0:10:13.22,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナだって…
Dialogue: 7,0:10:11.18,0:10:13.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,席娜不也…
Dialogue: 6,0:10:11.89,0:10:12.69,Text - JP - UP,,0,0,0,,ミミ
Dialogue: 7,0:10:11.89,0:10:12.69,Text - CN - UP,,0,0,0,,美美
Dialogue: 6,0:10:13.22,0:10:14.95,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナ
Dialogue: 7,0:10:13.22,0:10:14.95,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,席娜
Dialogue: 6,0:10:14.95,0:10:16.05,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミ
Dialogue: 7,0:10:14.95,0:10:16.05,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美
Dialogue: 6,0:10:16.50,0:10:18.48,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,どうしてこんなところに
Dialogue: 7,0:10:16.50,0:10:18.48,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你怎么在这种地方
Dialogue: 6,0:10:18.48,0:10:19.56,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あったの
Dialogue: 7,0:10:18.48,0:10:19.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,看看我找到了谁
Dialogue: 6,0:10:19.56,0:10:20.65,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ハルに
Dialogue: 7,0:10:19.56,0:10:20.65,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是哈鲁
Dialogue: 6,0:10:21.26,0:10:22.52,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ハルくん
Dialogue: 7,0:10:21.26,0:10:22.52,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哈鲁同学
Dialogue: 6,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.40,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,やっと保護者が来たか
Dialogue: 7,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.40,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,监护人终于来了吗
Dialogue: 6,0:10:27.40,0:10:30.07,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ごめんなさい　騒がしくなかった
Dialogue: 7,0:10:27.40,0:10:30.07,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,对不起  她没吵到你吧
Dialogue: 6,0:10:30.07,0:10:31.34,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うるさかった
Dialogue: 7,0:10:30.07,0:10:31.34,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,吵得不得了
Dialogue: 6,0:10:32.02,0:10:32.95,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だよね
Dialogue: 7,0:10:32.02,0:10:32.95,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 6,0:10:34.37,0:10:35.81,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,別に良いよ
Dialogue: 7,0:10:34.37,0:10:35.81,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不过也没关系
Dialogue: 6,0:10:36.64,0:10:39.60,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,部屋に戻ろうと思っていたところだし
Dialogue: 7,0:10:36.64,0:10:39.60,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,反正我本来就打算回宿舍了
Dialogue: 6,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.41,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫
Dialogue: 7,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 6,0:10:43.77,0:10:44.80,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,平気
Dialogue: 7,0:10:43.77,0:10:44.80,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 6,0:10:45.38,0:10:47.62,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,よくある　ただの立ちくらみ
Dialogue: 7,0:10:45.38,0:10:47.62,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,常有的事  只是头晕罢了
Dialogue: 6,0:10:47.62,0:10:49.66,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,一旦　ベッドに座って
Dialogue: 7,0:10:47.62,0:10:49.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,先在床上坐会吧
Dialogue: 6,0:10:49.66,0:10:51.09,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,良いよ　平気
Dialogue: 7,0:10:49.66,0:10:51.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不用了  我没事的
Dialogue: 6,0:10:51.09,0:10:51.62,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,でも…
Dialogue: 7,0:10:51.09,0:10:51.62,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 6,0:10:51.62,0:10:53.02,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いいってば
Dialogue: 7,0:10:51.62,0:10:53.02,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,都说没事了
Dialogue: 6,0:10:56.45,0:10:57.71,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,熱あるよ
Dialogue: 7,0:10:56.45,0:10:57.71,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你发烧了啊
Dialogue: 6,0:10:57.71,0:10:59.57,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いつものことだから
Dialogue: 7,0:10:57.71,0:10:59.57,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,常有的事罢了
Dialogue: 6,0:10:59.57,0:11:02.16,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,じゃあ　一緒に途中まで行こう
Dialogue: 7,0:10:59.57,0:11:02.16,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那我陪你走一段路吧
Dialogue: 6,0:11:02.16,0:11:03.64,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,平気だって
Dialogue: 7,0:11:02.16,0:11:03.64,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,都说了我没事
Dialogue: 6,0:11:05.47,0:11:06.97,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あ　ドア私が
Dialogue: 7,0:11:05.47,0:11:06.97,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊  我来开门
Dialogue: 6,0:11:06.97,0:11:08.81,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,せっかいだな
Dialogue: 7,0:11:06.97,0:11:08.81,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真是多管闲事啊
Dialogue: 6,0:11:08.81,0:11:10.02,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ここをつかまって
Dialogue: 7,0:11:08.81,0:11:10.02,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,抓着这里
Dialogue: 6,0:11:19.10,0:11:20.82,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ハルくんの部屋って…
Dialogue: 7,0:11:19.10,0:11:20.82,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你房间在哪来着…
Dialogue: 6,0:11:23.45,0:11:24.68,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ここでいい
Dialogue: 7,0:11:23.45,0:11:24.68,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,到这里就行了
Dialogue: 6,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.74,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もう平気だから
Dialogue: 7,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.74,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我已经没事了
Dialogue: 6,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.18,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,どうしたの　ミミ
Dialogue: 7,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.18,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,怎么了吗  美美
Dialogue: 6,0:11:45.24,0:11:47.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,馴染んだ日常に
Dialogue: 7,0:11:45.24,0:11:47.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,一如既往的日常里
Dialogue: 6,0:11:47.51,0:11:50.66,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,私の知らない　花が芽吹く
Dialogue: 7,0:11:47.51,0:11:50.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,有一朵花悄然绽放了
Dialogue: 6,0:11:52.59,0:11:54.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,早く帰ろう
Dialogue: 7,0:11:52.59,0:11:54.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我们早点回去吧
Dialogue: 6,0:11:54.94,0:11:55.70,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 7,0:11:54.94,0:11:55.70,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 6,0:12:10.14,0:12:11.65,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,さてと
Dialogue: 7,0:12:10.14,0:12:11.65,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 6,0:12:12.25,0:12:16.26,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あとは洗濯物出して　ベッド掃除かな
Dialogue: 7,0:12:12.25,0:12:16.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,然后就剩下洗衣服  还有打扫床铺了吧
Dialogue: 6,0:12:16.82,0:12:17.88,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミも行く
Dialogue: 7,0:12:16.82,0:12:17.88,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美要一起去吗
Dialogue: 6,0:12:18.47,0:12:19.51,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,行くー
Dialogue: 7,0:12:18.47,0:12:19.51,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,要去
Dialogue: 6,0:12:26.27,0:12:27.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,結ぶ？
Dialogue: 7,0:12:26.27,0:12:27.31,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,要扎起来吗？
Dialogue: 6,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.73,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ううん　とかして
Dialogue: 7,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.73,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不要  梳一下就行
Dialogue: 6,0:12:29.73,0:12:30.62,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 7,0:12:29.73,0:12:30.62,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 6,0:12:40.09,0:12:41.62,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,はい　終わり
Dialogue: 7,0:12:40.09,0:12:41.62,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好了  梳完了
Dialogue: 6,0:12:42.12,0:12:45.99,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,今度ミミがシーナの髪とかしてあげるね
Dialogue: 7,0:12:42.12,0:12:45.99,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,下次美美也要来帮你梳头
Dialogue: 6,0:12:45.99,0:12:46.58,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,え？
Dialogue: 7,0:12:45.99,0:12:46.58,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 6,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.44,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,結ぶほうがいい？
Dialogue: 7,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.44,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,还是帮你扎起来比较好？
Dialogue: 6,0:12:53.28,0:12:54.63,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,考えておく
Dialogue: 7,0:12:53.28,0:12:54.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,让我考虑一下
Dialogue: 6,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,お願いします
Dialogue: 7,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,拜托您了
Dialogue: 6,0:13:05.84,0:13:08.61,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミ　なんだか今日はご機嫌だね
Dialogue: 7,0:13:05.84,0:13:08.61,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美  你今天好像心情很不错呢
Dialogue: 6,0:13:10.22,0:13:13.94,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だって　今日はシーナが魔法の練習してないから
Dialogue: 7,0:13:10.22,0:13:13.94,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,因为今天席娜没去做魔法的练习呀
Dialogue: 6,0:13:13.94,0:13:15.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,それで？
Dialogue: 7,0:13:13.94,0:13:15.08,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,就因为这个？
Dialogue: 6,0:13:15.57,0:13:17.53,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,戻ったらクッキー焼こうよ
Dialogue: 7,0:13:15.57,0:13:17.53,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,回去之后我们一起去烤饼干吧
Dialogue: 6,0:13:17.92,0:13:18.44,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,え？
Dialogue: 7,0:13:17.92,0:13:18.44,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 6,0:13:19.11,0:13:23.82,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,困ったな　魔法の練習しようと思ってたんだけど
Dialogue: 7,0:13:19.11,0:13:23.82,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,糟了啊  我还想去练一会魔法来着
Dialogue: 6,0:13:26.26,0:13:27.22,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ハル
Dialogue: 7,0:13:26.26,0:13:27.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哈鲁
Dialogue: 6,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.41,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,また君らか
Dialogue: 7,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,又是你们啊
Dialogue: 6,0:13:30.44,0:13:32.41,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,こんなとこで何してんの？
Dialogue: 7,0:13:30.44,0:13:32.41,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,你在这里干什么呢？
Dialogue: 6,0:13:33.07,0:13:37.43,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,別に　朝から教室で追試受けて
Dialogue: 7,0:13:33.07,0:13:37.43,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,没什么  我去早上去教室参加了补考
Dialogue: 6,0:13:37.43,0:13:38.92,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,さっき終わったとこ
Dialogue: 7,0:13:37.43,0:13:38.92,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,刚刚才结束
Dialogue: 6,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.38,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,部屋帰ないの
Dialogue: 7,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.38,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你不回房间吗
Dialogue: 6,0:13:45.71,0:13:49.98,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,帰る前に　本返しに行こうかと思っていたんだけど
Dialogue: 7,0:13:45.71,0:13:49.98,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我本来想着回房间之前先去把书给还回去
Dialogue: 6,0:13:53.49,0:13:56.07,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もしかしてまた立ちくらみ
Dialogue: 7,0:13:53.49,0:13:56.07,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你该不会又头晕了吧
Dialogue: 6,0:13:56.07,0:13:57.28,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,じゃあ
Dialogue: 7,0:13:56.07,0:13:57.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,回头见
Dialogue: 6,0:14:00.71,0:14:01.66,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 7,0:14:00.71,0:14:01.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 6,0:14:02.66,0:14:07.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,私たち　これから参考書を借りに行こうと思ってたんだけど
Dialogue: 7,0:14:02.66,0:14:07.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我们刚好接下来打算去借点参考书
Dialogue: 6,0:14:07.13,0:14:08.29,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,そうなの
Dialogue: 7,0:14:07.13,0:14:08.29,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 6,0:14:08.69,0:14:09.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いや…
Dialogue: 7,0:14:08.69,0:14:09.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 6,0:14:11.53,0:14:13.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,と… とにかく
Dialogue: 7,0:14:11.53,0:14:13.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,总… 总之
Dialogue: 6,0:14:14.98,0:14:16.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ついでだし
Dialogue: 7,0:14:14.98,0:14:16.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,反正也顺路
Dialogue: 6,0:14:16.00,0:14:18.09,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,よかったら返しておくよ
Dialogue: 7,0:14:16.00,0:14:18.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,可以的话我们来帮你还吧
Dialogue: 6,0:14:26.17,0:14:28.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ごめん　頼む
Dialogue: 7,0:14:26.17,0:14:28.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉  拜托了
Dialogue: 6,0:14:30.27,0:14:31.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 7,0:14:30.27,0:14:31.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 6,0:14:32.78,0:14:33.80,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,えっと…
Dialogue: 7,0:14:32.78,0:14:33.80,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 6,0:14:34.32,0:14:37.28,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,これって　図書館のどの辺り
Dialogue: 7,0:14:34.32,0:14:37.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这本书  是在图书馆的哪里借的呢
Dialogue: 6,0:14:38.00,0:14:40.82,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,それは先輩たちの昔のノートだから
Dialogue: 7,0:14:38.00,0:14:40.82,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这是学姐们以前用过的笔记本
Dialogue: 6,0:14:41.29,0:14:42.44,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,図書館じゃない
Dialogue: 7,0:14:41.29,0:14:42.44,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不是图书馆的书
Dialogue: 6,0:14:42.44,0:14:43.66,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,そうなの
Dialogue: 7,0:14:42.44,0:14:43.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 6,0:14:44.25,0:14:48.45,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,地下書庫の隣にある倉庫に　こっそり置いてあるんだけど
Dialogue: 7,0:14:44.25,0:14:48.45,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这个一直放在地下书库边上那个仓库里
Dialogue: 6,0:14:48.91,0:14:51.75,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,授業内容が分かりやすくまとまっていて
Dialogue: 7,0:14:48.91,0:14:51.75,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,里面把课上教的内容整理得很简明易懂
Dialogue: 6,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.22,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,へぇ
Dialogue: 7,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 6,0:14:54.12,0:14:56.09,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,早く行かなきゃ
Dialogue: 7,0:14:54.12,0:14:56.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧走了
Dialogue: 6,0:14:56.09,0:14:57.84,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,晩ご飯間に合わない
Dialogue: 7,0:14:56.09,0:14:57.84,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不然赶不上晚饭了
Dialogue: 6,0:14:57.84,0:15:00.41,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,えっ　おやつもまだなのに
Dialogue: 7,0:14:57.84,0:15:00.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊  可我们还没吃点心呢
Dialogue: 6,0:15:00.41,0:15:01.88,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いいから
Dialogue: 7,0:15:00.41,0:15:01.88,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快走啦
Dialogue: 6,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.09,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ハルって
Dialogue: 7,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哈鲁你啊
Dialogue: 6,0:15:05.58,0:15:08.56,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,私服も制服も男子用だよね
Dialogue: 7,0:15:05.58,0:15:08.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,便服和校服都是男生款的呢
Dialogue: 6,0:15:09.41,0:15:10.86,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,女の子なのに
Dialogue: 7,0:15:09.41,0:15:10.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但你不是女生吗
Dialogue: 6,0:15:23.34,0:15:24.61,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミ
Dialogue: 7,0:15:23.34,0:15:24.61,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美
Dialogue: 6,0:15:28.84,0:15:30.27,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,気持ち悪い
Dialogue: 7,0:15:28.84,0:15:30.27,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这样很恶心吧
Dialogue: 6,0:15:31.74,0:15:34.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,君もおかしいと思う
Dialogue: 7,0:15:31.74,0:15:34.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你也觉得我很奇怪吗
Dialogue: 6,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.92,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ううん　ハルに似合ってるよ
Dialogue: 7,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.92,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,没啊  我觉得很适合你
Dialogue: 6,0:15:42.48,0:15:44.38,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だって自分で選んだんでしょ
Dialogue: 7,0:15:42.48,0:15:44.38,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,毕竟那是你自己选的嘛
Dialogue: 6,0:15:44.79,0:15:46.55,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ならなんもおかしくないじゃん
Dialogue: 7,0:15:44.79,0:15:46.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那就没什么好奇怪的
Dialogue: 6,0:15:51.80,0:15:52.97,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,そう
Dialogue: 7,0:15:51.80,0:15:52.97,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 6,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ありがとう
Dialogue: 7,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 6,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,今度　ミミも着てみていい？
Dialogue: 7,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.08,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,下次能让美美也穿穿看吗？
Dialogue: 6,0:16:00.08,0:16:02.03,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,はあ　いやだよ
Dialogue: 7,0:16:00.08,0:16:02.03,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,什么  我才不要呢
Dialogue: 6,0:16:04.01,0:16:04.81,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あの
Dialogue: 7,0:16:04.01,0:16:04.81,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 6,0:16:06.48,0:16:09.38,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,トツキさんも　ありがとう
Dialogue: 7,0:16:06.48,0:16:09.38,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,杜滋琪同学  也谢谢你
Dialogue: 6,0:16:12.00,0:16:13.47,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,どういたしまして
Dialogue: 7,0:16:12.00,0:16:13.47,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不用客气
Dialogue: 6,0:16:14.71,0:16:15.50,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,行こう
Dialogue: 7,0:16:14.71,0:16:15.50,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 6,0:16:16.09,0:16:17.72,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ハル　バイバーイ
Dialogue: 7,0:16:16.09,0:16:17.72,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哈鲁  拜拜
Dialogue: 6,0:16:18.53,0:16:19.95,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あ　ちょっと
Dialogue: 7,0:16:18.53,0:16:19.95,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊  你慢一点
Dialogue: 6,0:16:26.54,0:16:29.84,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,なんか　めんどくさい奴ら
Dialogue: 7,0:16:26.54,0:16:29.84,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,感觉  她们俩也很不让人省心呢
Dialogue: 6,0:16:32.26,0:16:34.01,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミも欲しいなー
Dialogue: 7,0:16:32.26,0:16:34.01,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美也好想要呢
Dialogue: 6,0:16:34.01,0:16:35.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ズボン？
Dialogue: 7,0:16:34.01,0:16:35.13,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,想要裤子吗？
Dialogue: 6,0:16:35.13,0:16:35.84,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 7,0:16:35.13,0:16:35.84,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 6,0:16:36.24,0:16:38.72,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,今度の返礼の日に探してみようか
Dialogue: 7,0:16:36.24,0:16:38.72,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那在下次的回礼日上找找看吧
Dialogue: 6,0:16:43.49,0:16:44.75,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,きれい
Dialogue: 7,0:16:43.49,0:16:44.75,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 6,0:16:45.11,0:16:46.42,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ほんとだね
Dialogue: 7,0:16:45.11,0:16:46.42,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,确实呢
Dialogue: 6,0:16:47.28,0:16:50.42,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あのね　ハルってすごいんだよ
Dialogue: 7,0:16:47.28,0:16:50.42,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,听我说  哈鲁她好厉害的
Dialogue: 6,0:16:50.42,0:16:51.96,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,授業休んでても
Dialogue: 7,0:16:50.42,0:16:51.96,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,她就算不去上课
Dialogue: 6,0:16:51.96,0:16:54.19,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミよりいい点数取れるの
Dialogue: 7,0:16:51.96,0:16:54.19,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,也能考得比美美好
Dialogue: 6,0:16:54.19,0:16:56.70,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,保健室でもずっと勉強しててね
Dialogue: 7,0:16:54.19,0:16:56.70,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,她在医务室也一直都在学习
Dialogue: 6,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.26,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん　かっこいいよね
Dialogue: 7,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯  她真的很了不起呢
Dialogue: 6,0:16:59.94,0:17:02.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,でも　ミミもかっこいいよ
Dialogue: 7,0:16:59.94,0:17:02.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但是  美美你也很了不起哦
Dialogue: 6,0:17:03.78,0:17:05.21,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ほんと？
Dialogue: 7,0:17:03.78,0:17:05.21,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 6,0:17:05.71,0:17:09.21,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミはいつでも　物事をまっすぐ捉えて
Dialogue: 7,0:17:05.71,0:17:09.21,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你总是能直率地去看待事物
Dialogue: 6,0:17:09.71,0:17:11.94,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミの言葉で伝えてくれるから
Dialogue: 7,0:17:09.71,0:17:11.94,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,然后用你自己的话表达出来
Dialogue: 6,0:17:13.07,0:17:15.93,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だから　アリやハルくんも
Dialogue: 7,0:17:13.07,0:17:15.93,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,所以  可能这就是亚里和哈鲁
Dialogue: 6,0:17:15.93,0:17:18.24,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みんな素直になれるのかなって
Dialogue: 7,0:17:15.93,0:17:18.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,以及大家能对你敞开心扉的原因吧
Dialogue: 6,0:17:22.54,0:17:25.99,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,それは　とても素敵なことだと思う
Dialogue: 7,0:17:22.54,0:17:25.99,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,在我看来  这是件十分美妙的事情
Dialogue: 6,0:17:28.01,0:17:29.92,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミの言葉って？
Dialogue: 7,0:17:28.01,0:17:29.92,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,美美自己的话？
Dialogue: 6,0:17:29.92,0:17:34.70,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うーん　偏見とか忖度がないっていうか
Dialogue: 7,0:17:29.92,0:17:34.70,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯  就是说你没有偏见不会揣度别人
Dialogue: 6,0:17:34.70,0:17:36.87,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,へんけん？そんたく？
Dialogue: 7,0:17:34.70,0:17:36.87,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,偏见？揣度？
Dialogue: 6,0:17:37.41,0:17:40.12,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,心の中がきれいっていうか
Dialogue: 7,0:17:37.41,0:17:40.12,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,也可以说是你的内心很纯净
Dialogue: 6,0:17:40.69,0:17:43.02,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,モヤモヤしたものがないっていうか
Dialogue: 7,0:17:40.69,0:17:43.02,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,完全不会有负面的情绪
Dialogue: 6,0:18:04.94,0:18:09.34,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,私もかっこいいって思ってもらえるよう　がんばろう
Dialogue: 7,0:18:04.94,0:18:09.34,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我也要好好加油  让别人觉得我很了不起
Dialogue: 6,0:18:17.48,0:18:21.26,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナはすごくもかっこよくもなくていいよ…
Dialogue: 7,0:18:17.48,0:18:21.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,就算你不厉害不了不起  也没关系的…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:30.52,0:18:31.63,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ここだね
Dialogue: 7,0:18:30.52,0:18:31.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是这里吧
Dialogue: 6,0:18:33.56,0:18:35.39,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,奥に灯あるよ
Dialogue: 7,0:18:33.56,0:18:35.39,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,里面有灯呢
Dialogue: 6,0:18:35.74,0:18:37.51,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,暗いから気をつけ…
Dialogue: 7,0:18:35.74,0:18:37.51,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这里很暗  当心点…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:48.15,0:18:50.62,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いっちちち…
Dialogue: 7,0:18:48.15,0:18:50.62,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好痛啊…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.72,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナ大丈夫？
Dialogue: 7,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.72,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,席娜你没事吧？
Dialogue: 6,0:18:52.72,0:18:53.44,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 7,0:18:52.72,0:18:53.44,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 6,0:18:54.44,0:18:55.82,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミは平気？
Dialogue: 7,0:18:54.44,0:18:55.82,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,美美也没事吧？
Dialogue: 6,0:18:55.82,0:18:57.59,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,なんともないよ
Dialogue: 7,0:18:55.82,0:18:57.59,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我哪都没事
Dialogue: 6,0:18:58.10,0:18:59.43,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ちょっと待ってて
Dialogue: 7,0:18:58.10,0:18:59.43,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你等我一下
Dialogue: 6,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.16,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,えっと
Dialogue: 7,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.16,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 6,0:19:02.16,0:19:03.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あった
Dialogue: 7,0:19:02.16,0:19:03.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 6,0:19:07.73,0:19:09.10,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,明るくなった
Dialogue: 7,0:19:07.73,0:19:09.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这样就变亮了
Dialogue: 6,0:19:10.17,0:19:11.35,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナ
Dialogue: 7,0:19:10.17,0:19:11.35,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,席娜
Dialogue: 6,0:19:12.95,0:19:14.47,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怪我してる
Dialogue: 7,0:19:12.95,0:19:14.47,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你受伤了
Dialogue: 6,0:19:14.87,0:19:15.45,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,えっ
Dialogue: 7,0:19:14.87,0:19:15.45,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 6,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.30,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ああ本当だ
Dialogue: 7,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.30,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊还真是
Dialogue: 6,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.54,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いたた…
Dialogue: 7,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 6,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.93,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,階段で擦っちゃったかな
Dialogue: 7,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.93,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,估计是擦到台阶了吧
Dialogue: 6,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.52,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,帰るとき保健室寄っていい
Dialogue: 7,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.52,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,回去时能去趟医务室吗
Dialogue: 6,0:19:25.96,0:19:27.15,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,包帯もらって…
Dialogue: 7,0:19:25.96,0:19:27.15,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我去拿点绷带…
Dialogue: 6,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.98,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,立っちゃダメ
Dialogue: 7,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.98,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不能站起来
Dialogue: 6,0:19:29.98,0:19:32.69,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,えっ　ど… どうし…
Dialogue: 7,0:19:29.98,0:19:32.69,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,诶  为… 为什…
Dialogue: 6,0:19:33.12,0:19:34.57,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ちょ… ちょっと
Dialogue: 7,0:19:33.12,0:19:34.57,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,等… 等等
Dialogue: 6,0:19:34.57,0:19:35.66,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,待って
Dialogue: 7,0:19:34.57,0:19:35.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 6,0:19:36.51,0:19:40.10,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もしかして　修復魔法を使うつもり？
Dialogue: 7,0:19:36.51,0:19:40.10,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,你该不会是想用修复魔法吧？
Dialogue: 6,0:19:40.10,0:19:41.29,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,そうだよ
Dialogue: 7,0:19:40.10,0:19:41.29,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 6,0:19:41.29,0:19:43.62,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ダメだよ　擦り傷くらいで
Dialogue: 7,0:19:41.29,0:19:43.62,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不行  这只是个小擦伤而已
Dialogue: 6,0:19:44.01,0:19:45.91,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,でも痛いんでしょ
Dialogue: 7,0:19:44.01,0:19:45.91,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但是你不是很痛吗
Dialogue: 6,0:19:46.29,0:19:47.21,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,痛くないよ
Dialogue: 7,0:19:46.29,0:19:47.21,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不痛哦
Dialogue: 6,0:19:47.21,0:19:49.86,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うそ　痛いって言ったもん
Dialogue: 7,0:19:47.21,0:19:49.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,骗人  你刚还喊好痛
Dialogue: 6,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.14,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫
Dialogue: 7,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.14,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我没事的
Dialogue: 6,0:19:51.14,0:19:53.76,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,こんなことで魔力使うのもったいないし
Dialogue: 7,0:19:51.14,0:19:53.76,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,把魔力用在这种小伤上太浪费了
Dialogue: 6,0:19:53.76,0:19:55.68,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もったいなくない
Dialogue: 7,0:19:53.76,0:19:55.68,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,一点也不浪费
Dialogue: 6,0:19:55.68,0:19:57.64,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,こんなことでもない
Dialogue: 7,0:19:55.68,0:19:57.64,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这也不是什么小伤
Dialogue: 6,0:20:00.07,0:20:01.24,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,平気だよ
Dialogue: 7,0:20:00.07,0:20:01.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 6,0:20:02.06,0:20:05.48,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,腕の怪我の時もミミに助けてもらったし
Dialogue: 7,0:20:02.06,0:20:05.48,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我手臂受伤的时候也是你帮我治好的
Dialogue: 6,0:20:06.82,0:20:09.90,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,こんな　いつも助けてもらってばかりじゃ…
Dialogue: 7,0:20:06.82,0:20:09.90,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我也不能总是这样让你帮忙…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:10.25,0:20:11.15,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ずるい…
Dialogue: 7,0:20:10.25,0:20:11.15,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不公平…
Dialogue: 6,0:20:13.70,0:20:14.92,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ずるいよ
Dialogue: 7,0:20:13.70,0:20:14.92,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这不公平
Dialogue: 6,0:20:14.92,0:20:16.79,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いつもシーナばっかり
Dialogue: 7,0:20:14.92,0:20:16.79,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,一直以来都是你
Dialogue: 6,0:20:17.65,0:20:20.28,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナばっかりミミにお願いして
Dialogue: 7,0:20:17.65,0:20:20.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是你向我提出要求
Dialogue: 6,0:20:21.08,0:20:23.66,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怪我しないで帰ってきてとか
Dialogue: 7,0:20:21.08,0:20:23.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,要我平安无事地回来
Dialogue: 6,0:20:23.66,0:20:26.25,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,体大切にとか
Dialogue: 7,0:20:23.66,0:20:26.25,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,要我珍惜自己的身体
Dialogue: 6,0:20:26.25,0:20:30.59,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,それなのに　ミミはシーナにお願いできないの
Dialogue: 7,0:20:26.25,0:20:30.59,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你都这样要求我了  我却不能向你提出要求吗
Dialogue: 6,0:20:39.45,0:20:43.84,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミのお願い　シーナは聞いてくれないの
Dialogue: 7,0:20:39.45,0:20:43.84,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你可不可以也听一听美美的请求呢
Dialogue: 6,0:20:45.73,0:20:46.59,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミ
Dialogue: 7,0:20:45.73,0:20:46.59,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美美
Dialogue: 6,0:20:53.06,0:20:54.09,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だめだよ
Dialogue: 7,0:20:53.06,0:20:54.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,这样不行
Dialogue: 6,0:20:56.49,0:20:57.35,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だめ…
Dialogue: 7,0:20:56.49,0:20:57.35,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不行…
Dialogue: 6,0:21:31.24,0:21:32.22,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ありがとう
Dialogue: 7,0:21:31.24,0:21:32.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 6,0:21:34.25,0:21:36.03,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミのおかげだよ
Dialogue: 7,0:21:34.25,0:21:36.03,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,都是多亏了你
Dialogue: 6,0:21:37.14,0:21:38.45,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミミのおかげで
Dialogue: 7,0:21:37.14,0:21:38.45,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,多亏了美美
Dialogue: 6,0:21:39.28,0:21:41.60,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もう　痛くないよ
Dialogue: 7,0:21:39.28,0:21:41.60,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,伤口  现在已经不痛了
Dialogue: 6,0:21:43.27,0:21:44.56,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,シーナ
Dialogue: 7,0:21:43.27,0:21:44.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,席娜
Dialogue: 6,0:21:48.59,0:21:51.69,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,やっぱり　ちょっと恥ずかしいね
Dialogue: 7,0:21:48.59,0:21:51.69,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,果然还是有点难为情呢
Dialogue: 6,0:21:52.42,0:21:53.96,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,そう？
Dialogue: 7,0:21:52.42,0:21:53.96,Text - CN,,15,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 6,0:21:58.26,0:22:00.68,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,おやつも晩ご飯も
Dialogue: 7,0:21:58.26,0:22:00.68,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,点心和晚饭什么的
Dialogue: 6,0:22:02.01,0:22:04.23,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,間に合わなくてもいいや
Dialogue: 7,0:22:02.01,0:22:04.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,就算赶不上也无所谓了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:40.83,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}会いたい
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.49,0:01:40.83,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:40.83,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}想见你
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.49,0:01:40.83,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}想见你
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.83,0:01:43.83,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}きみに会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.83,0:01:43.83,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}きみに会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.83,0:01:43.83,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}好想见你
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.83,0:01:43.83,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}好想见你
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.22,0:02:00.39,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)}明日　朝目が覚めたら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:02:00.39,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　朝目が覚めたら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:02:00.39,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}等到明天早晨睁开眼睛
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.22,0:02:00.39,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)}等到明天早晨睁开眼睛
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.52,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,「おはよう」ってきみに言えること
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.52,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}「おはよう」ってきみに言えること
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.52,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我能对你道一声「早安」
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.52,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,我能对你道一声「早安」
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.52,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}「ただいま」って言ったらさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.52,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}「ただいま」って言ったらさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.52,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}当我对你说「我回来了」
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.52,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}当我对你说「我回来了」
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.52,0:02:09.78,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)}「おかえり」が待ってること
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:09.78,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}「おかえり」が待ってること
